                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>Blue Tokai vs Sleepy Owl?</h3>
                                        <p>Different segments. Blue Tokai roaster-specialty + café. Sleepy Owl cold brew + convenience + ready-to-drink. Coexist by segment differentiation.</p>
                                        <h3>Is cold brew a real long-term category India?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes — growing 25-40% YoY. India cold brew category still emerging + significant expansion runway.</p>
                                        <h3>Should new coffee brands do cold brew?</h3>
                                        <p>Category niching possible — specific origin + specific brew method + specific wellness focus. Sleepy Owl dominates broad cold brew.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest coffee segment lesson?</h3>
                                        <p>Segment differentiation + category creation + convenience focus + quick commerce combined. Not one-size-fits-all coffee playbook.</p>
